# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT IGNORED — deliberate inclusions
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The following are project source-of-truth data and MUST remain
# version-controlled. Do not add them to this file.
#
#   data/services/master-service-registry.json
#   data/locations/master-location-registry.json
#   data/matrices/service-location-master-matrix.json   (~16 MB)
#   data/matrices/service-location-master-matrix.csv    (~7.5 MB)
#
# Rationale:
#   06-master-service-registry.md §48  — machine-readable registry
#   07-master-location-registry.md §15 — machine-readable registry
#   08-service-location-matrix.md  §50 — preserve BOTH csv and json
#   19-analytics-measurement.md   §141 — public IDs may be committed
#
# The matrix JSON is large but is research source data, not build
# output. It is consumed at build time to validate approved routes
# against known relationships (08-service-location-matrix.md §112).
#
# If repository size later becomes a problem, evaluate Git LFS
# rather than removing these files, and record the decision in
# 22-decisions-change-log.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Throwaway audit render made by scripts/report-unfilled-slots.mjs
/.slot-audit/

# Original photo files kept out of public/ (large, may carry metadata)
/image-originals/

# tesseract.js language-data cache (scripts/ocr-images.mjs)
eng.traineddata
